Subject: [PATCH 4.4 83/91] ARM: dts: at91: sama5d3: fix maximum peripheral clock rates
Date:   Thu, 13 Feb 2020 07:20:40 -0800
Message-Id: <20200213151854.958338390@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.25.0
